<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 190 mln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 190 mln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction October 29 versus October 22  SUVK :</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   166/173     349/356</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.10/3.06   3.43/3.29</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.10/3.06   3.43/3.29</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.10/3.06   3.41/3.27</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million   50/100     140/270</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    350/1,100   610/1,270</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.0 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 41,422 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
